          {
            "title": "Example: Data validation",
            "id": 92547,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lance um <code>ValueError</code> se o valor no índice <code>position</code> em <code>ratings</code> não puder ser recuperado.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ratings = [\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"position = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ratings[position]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"raise\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No value found at the given position&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"91\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;file.py&quot;, line 7, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    raise ValueError(&quot;No value found at the given position&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ValueError: no value found at the given position\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>ValueError</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91811,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que o código a seguir gera um <code>SyntaxError</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"44\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"&quot;33&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;file.py&quot;, line 2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                 ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: unexpected EOF while parsing\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O Python espera que haja mais código após a instrução <code>if</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>44</code> não está definido</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;</code> não pode ser usado aqui</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O Python espera que haja mais código após a instrução <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91805,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que tipo de erro o seguinte código irá gerar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" eggs &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Box is not full&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/default/code/file.py&quot;, line 2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(&quot;Box is not full&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndentationError: expected an indented block\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>IndentationError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>NameError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>IndentationError</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Error messages",
            "id": 92546,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o bloco de código.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperature = \" /><text value=\"-55\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"-25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &gt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"raise\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Temperature is outside expected range&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"RangeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;file.py&quot;, line 4, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    raise ValueError(&quot;Temperature is outside expected range&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ValueError: Temperature is outside expected range\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>raise</code> seguido de <code>ValueError</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: the `pass` keyword",
            "id": 92549,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Certifique-se de que <code>attempts</code> seja atualizado independentemente de haver ou não um erro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"attempts = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tickets = \" /><text value=\"55\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"absentees = \" /><text value=\"&quot;7&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  attendance = tickets - absentees\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"finally\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  attempts += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(attempts)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"always\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>finally</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error messages",
            "id": 92541,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como fornecemos uma mensagem de erro personalizada quando uma exceção é gerada?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>raise Exception(\"Custom message here&gt;\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(\"Custom message here\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Isso não é possível</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>raise Exception(\"Custom message here&gt;\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: the `pass` keyword",
            "id": 92540,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que será impresso pelo seguinte código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"adults = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"age = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  adults += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(adults)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Indexing",
            "id": 91807,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que tipo de erro o seguinte código irá gerar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;apples&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bananas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cherries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    shopping[3]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndexError: shopping index out of range\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>IndexError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>IndentationError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>IndexError</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
